Harness update from the owner, live from your next episode: (1) a new `ram` action `objects` lists the 18 object slots (class, x, y and the $61CA+slot value that holds boss HP). Use it to find bosses, Warp Stars, and the Star Rod piece after a boss kill: collect it by floating above it and pressing Down, since the stage does not end by waiting. (2) RAM addresses are now hex everywhere: "61CA", "$61CA" and "0x61CA" all mean $61CA. They used to be read as decimal without the 0x prefix. (3) labkit flowsearch: thin platforms and ladders are no longer treated as one-way (ONEWAY is now empty).
